le tracce del piccolo, disposto a tutto pur di ritrovarlo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"My Son","overview":"The story of a busy man, who fills his time travelling to Africa, South America and the Middle East. His passion for his job has distanced him from his loved ones. He’s been divorced for three years and has since seen his son very little. When the latter disappears, he is forced to stand still, and soon discovers things about his ex-wife and, above all, his son. A terrible feeling of guilt overwhelms him and he decides to find his son at all costs..."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Passionné par son métier, Julien voyage énormément à l’étranger. Ce manque de présence a fait exploser son couple quelques années auparavant. Lors d’une escale en France, il découvre sur son répondeur un message de son ex femme en larmes : leur petit garçon de sept ans a disparu lors d’un bivouac en montagne avec sa classe. Julien se précipite à sa recherche et rien ne pourra l’arrêter.","tagline":"Un père, une disparition, une traque."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FlLz2yUu4BkQjHZ8SXedEDHO3n.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y1ObBSN9kQabYMNx7jPBgkVmyFZ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":451646,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FlLz2yUu4BkQjHZ8SXedEDHO3n.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6FlLz2yUu4BkQjHZ8SXedEDHO3n.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FlLz2yUu4BkQjHZ8SXedEDHO3n.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6FlLz2yUu4BkQjHZ8SXedEDHO3n.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xn1tTJojdXbSIVXVWwouTXxGRQ4.jpg","preview